<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>What Does She Have</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">FLØRE</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">What Does She Have</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3xNMIHsncO6D3f4jD5I2Vc</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.030" end="00:06.600">Da-da-da-da-daa</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.600" end="00:10.240">You told me she's just a friend</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.240" end="00:12.720">Pretty but boring</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.720" end="00:15.580">But do u really mean it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.580" end="00:17.590">I've been purposely ignoring</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.590" end="00:20.310">The subconscious smile you wear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.310" end="00:23.820">Every time you mention her, right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.820" end="00:28.120">You told me she's just a friend</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.120" end="00:34.520">But why do I cry my self back to sleep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.520" end="00:40.310">Lucid dreaming it was me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.310" end="00:44.090">What does she have that I don't?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.090" end="00:45.590">What does she have</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.560" end="00:49.170">So likeable, a freak in bed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.170" end="00:52.140">Why is it you're so obsessed?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.140" end="00:55.910">What does she have that I don't?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.910" end="00:57.580">What does she have</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.580" end="01:00.620">Is it the perfect hair, porcelain skin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.620" end="01:03.430">A secret song to lure you in?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.430" end="01:09.140">Da-da-da-da-daa</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.140" end="01:16.040">Da-da-da-da-daa</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.040" end="01:19.110">I know that we are just friends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.110" end="01:20.860">So why are you texting</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.860" end="01:23.790">At 3 AM sending mixed signals and pictures</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.790" end="01:27.730">Of you in the mirror wearing nothing but ignorance</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.730" end="01:29.360">We shouldn't do this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.360" end="01:30.860">Too much to risk</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.760" end="01:32.260">But what's to it?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.890" end="01:33.390">Should we do it? Nah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.930" end="01:36.570">Crying my self back to sleep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.570" end="01:38.080">Back to sleep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.080" end="01:44.050">Can't u see it should be me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.050" end="01:48.060">What does she have that I don't?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.060" end="01:49.560">What does she have</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.410" end="01:52.670">So likeable, a freak in bed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.670" end="01:55.630">Why is it you're so obsessed?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.630" end="01:59.600">What does she have that I don't?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.600" end="02:01.270">What does she have</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.270" end="02:04.160">Is it the perfect hair, porcelain skin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.160" end="02:07.730">A secret song to lure you in?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.730" end="02:10.110">Is it the way she loves the summer sun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.110" end="02:12.750">The way she's lighthearted and fun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.750" end="02:18.610">The way she's pretty even when she cries</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.610" end="02:21.670">The freckles 'round her perfect nose</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.670" end="02:24.420">The tiny dress that makes her float</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.420" end="02:29.960">The way she might be everything i'm not</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.960" end="02:31.460">Everything I'm not</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.090" end="02:36.090">Oh what does she have that I don't?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.090" end="02:39.070">So likeable, a freak in bed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.070" end="02:42.000">Why is it you're so obsessed?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.000" end="02:45.830">What does she have that I don't?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.830" end="02:47.330">What does she have</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.310" end="02:50.320">Is it the perfect hair, porcelain skin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.320" end="02:57.590">A secret song to lure you in?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.590" end="03:04.900">What does she have?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.900" end="03:09.450">What does she have that I don't?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.450" end="03:10.950">What does she have</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.860" end="03:13.950">Is it the perfect hair, porcelain skin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.950" end="03:17.550">A secret song to lure you in?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.550" end="03:21.550" /></div></body></tt>